    given-names: "Elaheh"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ellieghorbani/AgenticDB-SJ"
abstract: >
  A provenance-aware natural-language database copilot over real relational,
  geospatial, and vector data using PostgreSQL, PostGIS, pgvector, FastAPI,
  OpenAI structured planning, deterministic SQL templates, AST validation,
  restricted read-only execution, and evidence-backed answers.
